WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:16.482
- ♪ ONE AT A TIME ♪

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:23.656
♪ I PUT MEN LIKE YOU
BEHIND BARS EVERY DAY ♪

00:00:23.689 --> 00:00:26.192
♪ ONE AT A TIME ♪

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:31.264
- ♪ LEGATEAUX,
YOU MAY TAKE MY YEARS ♪

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:37.470
♪ BUT CANNOT LOCK
MY SOUL AWAY ♪

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:39.305
♪ ALL THE YEARS
I HAD TO RUN ♪

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:40.373
- ♪ I CHASED YOU
THROUGH THE YEARS ♪

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:42.208
- ♪ SO LONG AGO IT ALL BEGUN ♪

00:00:42.241 --> 00:00:43.776
- ♪ NOW YOUR JOURNEY'S
AT AN END ♪

00:00:43.809 --> 00:00:45.411
- ♪ IN THE SHADOWS
ON MY SHAME ♪

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:46.446
- ♪ YOU WILL PAY
FOR WHAT YOU'VE DONE ♪

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:48.081
- ♪ BUT WAS I EVER TO BLAME? ♪

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.415
- ♪ DEATH WILL BE
YOUR ONLY FRIEND ♪

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:50.850
- ♪ DO I LET
THIS FIGHT END NOW? ♪

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:52.285
- ♪ DO NOT INTERRUPT ME ♪

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:53.853
- ♪ JUST TO END
THIS LIFE OF PAIN ♪

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.288
- ♪ LET ME FINISH
WHAT I NEED TO SAY ♪

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.589
- ♪ WILL THE END
BE WELCOME NOW? ♪

00:00:56.622 --> 00:00:57.690
- ♪ FINE, I'LL LET YOU
FINISH FIRST ♪

00:00:57.723 --> 00:00:59.525
- ♪ WILL MY JOURNEY
BE IN VAIN? ♪

00:00:59.558 --> 00:01:00.693
- ♪ DON'T LET ME
GET IN YOUR WAY ♪

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:02.662
- ♪ I ONLY STOLE
A LOAF OF BREAD ♪

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:04.430
- ♪ ARE YOU FINISHED NOW? ♪
- ♪ ALL I NEEDED ♪

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:06.599
♪ TO SURVIVE ♪
- ♪ OKAY, NOW IT'S MY TURN ♪

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:07.700
- ♪ IF I END UP
IN YOUR CELL ♪

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.168
- ♪ CAN WE HAVE
SOME GIVE AND TAKE? ♪

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:10.603
- ♪ WHY SHOULD I HAVE
STAYED ALIVE? ♪

00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:12.105
- ♪ LET ME GET A WORD,
AT LEAST ♪

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.774
- ♪ DO I TELL HIM
THAT I LOVE HIM ♪

00:01:14.807 --> 00:01:17.376
♪ DO I TELL HIM
OF HIS CHILD ♪

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.378
- ♪ NOW, WHERE DID THIS BITCH
COME FROM ♪

00:01:19.411 --> 00:01:23.182
- ♪ I HAVE NO IDEA ♪
- ♪ ONE AT A TIME ♪

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:25.318
- ♪ WILL HE EVER KNOW
HIS DAUGHTER? ♪

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:26.586
- ♪ LADY, SERIOUSLY,
PLEASE HANG ON ♪

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.187
- ♪ WILL HE RECOGNIZE
HER EYES? ♪

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:29.522
- ♪ IT'S HARD ENOUGH
TO TALK TO HIM ♪

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:31.457
- ♪ DID YOU SAY MY DAUGHTER? ♪

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.860
- ♪ YOURS AND MINE ♪
- ♪ ONE AT A TIME ♪

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:35.728
all: ♪ THE TRUMPETS
CALL OUT FREEDOM ♪

00:01:35.761 --> 00:01:37.163
- ♪ THIS ALL HAS TO HAPPEN
ON THE SAME BLOCK? ♪

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:38.464
all: ♪ LET THE MARCHING
SHAKE THE GROUND ♪

00:01:38.497 --> 00:01:40.199
- ♪ NOW THIS IS JUST A JOKE ♪

00:01:40.232 --> 00:01:43.469
♪ WE COULD SOLVE ALL THESE
ISSUES IF EVERYONE JUST SPOKE ♪

00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:45.171
♪ ONE AT A TIME ♪

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:46.873
- ♪ TAKING WHAT WE CAN, 'CAUSE
THINGS ARE GETTING WORSE ♪

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:49.609
♪ TAKING WHAT WE CAN
FROM EVERY POCKET AND PURSE ♪

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:50.610
- ♪ ONE AT A TIME ♪

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:52.879
- ♪ THE MEN HAVE COME ♪

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:54.747
all: ♪ THEIR BLOOD
WILL SPILL ♪

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:56.449
- ♪ ONE AT TIME ♪

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:58.284
- ♪ THE YEARS
DESTROYED THE MAN ♪

00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:00.820
♪ SHE KNEW
BEFORE WE PARTED ♪

00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:03.289
all: ♪ AND WHEN LOVE AND WAR
AND BLOOD AND GLORY'S ♪

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:05.224
♪ BARRACKS
HAVE BEEN CLIMBED ♪

00:02:05.257 --> 00:02:07.860
♪ WE WILL DIE ♪
- ♪ I WILL LOVE ♪

00:02:07.893 --> 00:02:09.328
- ♪ YEARS, THEY PASS ♪

00:02:09.361 --> 00:02:11.864
- CAN'T WE SPEAK?

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:12.932
all: ♪ ONE ♪

00:02:12.965 --> 00:02:15.835
both: ♪ HERE WE GO AGAIN,
POPPING IN AND OUT ♪

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:18.638
♪ DON'T HAVE MUCH TO DO
WITH WHAT THIS IS ABOUT ♪

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:20.273
all: ♪ A TIME ♪

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:26.245
- ♪ WHY ARE WE ALL
FACING THE SAME WAY? ♪

00:02:26.278 --> 00:02:31.817
- IS THE CITY ON FIRE?
WHAT'S WITH ALL THE SMOKE?

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:33.920
OH, NOW WE'RE ALL EARS.

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:35.822
GREAT.

00:02:36.855 --> 00:02:38.455
[grand orchestral music]

